  "row_count": 21,
  "notes": {
    "raw": "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated. \nPhase change: 1136 K, α - β transition point of Zr; $\\Delta H^{\\circ} = 0.951$ kcal/mol. \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-2000 K: $Cp^{0} = 8.828 + 0.058 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.751 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ $H^{0} - H_{298}^{0} = 8.828 \\times 10^{-3} T + 0.029 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 0.751 \\times 10^{2} T^{-1} - 2.887$ \nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-1136 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 59.112 - 1.337 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 1.073 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 8.050 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ $\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr}^{\\circ} = 59.112 + 1.337 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 1.073 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 4.025 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 31.973 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ 1136-2000 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 56.616 - 0.168 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.942 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 62.550 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ $\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr}^{\\circ} = 56.616 + 0.168 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.942 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 31.275 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 21.424 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \nSource: Data from Mills (80) who estimated all except enthalpy of formation at 298 K. ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "\\*Data except enthalpy of formation at 298 K estimated.",
